 "quirks": [
  "One voice per track (16 at most; Voices caps it): notes_write spreads chords over tracks.",
  "Velocity is the per-track Velocity column (sticky: it holds for later notes), not the note's own velocity.",
  "Glide only slides between overlapping notes on the same track.",
  "The profiler heard A2 for every note on its default patch: a bright FM spectrum fools the pitch tracker. Its source plays 440 · 2^((note − 69)/12) times each operator's ratio, the note conversion Pedal SH101 uses (measured at 440 Hz), so notes play as written.",
  "Operators run in order 1 → 4; which ones are heard (carriers) depends on Algorithm: in 1 (linear chain) only Operator 4.",
  "Every parameter at its maximum at once peaks above 0 dBFS (+3.4 dBFS); no single parameter does."
 ],
